      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكدّح</span></b>  <i>It</i> (the skin) <i>became scratched,</i> or
<i>lacerated, much,</i> or <i>many times,</i> or <i>in many
places.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَقَعَ مِنَ السَّطْحِ فَتَكَدَّحَ</span> <i>He
fell from the flat top,</i> or <i>roof,</i> of the house, <i>and
became much broken</i> [<i>in his skin</i>]. (L.)

